    "web": "Explicit Load demo/Open VAB, Program/Tone, note and Play/Stop; selecting or loading creates no audio. Read/prepare before commit, stale read fencing, original source isolated from editable code. Host gain0.6 once and8ms software transport fade; original ADPCM/ADSR/tuning/loop unchanged.",
