    "export": "exportVab(bank,{toneNumber}) preserves sourceProgram/rawattrs/samplepadding, packs Tone0/Sample1. No intermediateJSON; not arbitrary edited-synth-to-VAB conversion.",
    "limits": "Web opens combined VAB v6/v7. API also accepts splitVH/VB. Shared reverbOff, driver vibrato/portamento/keyzone layering and PSF song playback are separate."
